  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Honey Soap.png|200px|left|Honey soap]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n |level = 84\n |price = 1 to 327\n |time = 1 hr\n |source = {{Infoicon|bathk|bigger|link=Bath Kiosk}}\n |xp = 39\n |base = 91\n |dia = 4\n |time3 = 51 min\n}}\n'''Honey soap''' is a [[Products|product]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 84.\n\nLike all [[products]], it is stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Making honey soap'''===\n[[File:Bath Kiosk.png|150px|left|Bath Kiosk]]\nHoney soap is made in the [[Bath Kiosk]].\n\nTo make honey soap, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Goat Milk.png|75px|Goat milk|link=Goat Milk]]\n|[[File:Cacao.png|75px|Cacao|link=Cacao]]\n|[[File:Honeycomb.png|75px|Honeycomb|link=Honeycomb]]\n|-\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x2'''\n|'''x1'''\n|}\nIt takes 1 hour to make one bar of honey soap, and 51 minutes in a fully [[Masteries|mastered]] kiosk. Each bar gives players 39 [[experience]] points.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Selling honey soap'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|Roadside shop]]\n\n*Honey soap can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 3,276 {{Infoicon|Coin}} for 10 bars.\n*Buying the ingredients required to make honey soap costs 304 {{Infoicon|Coin}}.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n\n*[[Boat]] orders ask for 2 honey soaps per crate, up to a total of 8 per boat.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Strategy tips'''===\n\n* A bit odd as you would need [[Honeycomb]] to make this product, if possible, you would want to harvest 4 of those, use 3 to make [[Beeswax]] and the last for this one.\n{{navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Honigseife\n|es = Jabón de miel\n|fr = Savon au Miel\n|it = Sapone al miele\n|nl = Honingzeep\n|no = Honningsåpe\n|ru = Медовое мыло\n|zh = Honey Soap\n}}\n[[pt-br:Sabonete de mel]]\n\n[[Category:Bath Kiosk Products]]\n[[Category:Goat Milk Products]]\n[[Category:Cacao Products]]\n[[Category:Honeycomb Products]]",
